WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:01.403
- Have you heard the conspiracy

00:00:01.403 --> 00:00:04.329
about McDonald's, about their ice cream.

00:00:04.329 --> 00:00:05.482
